"P2155439904" "Protect Subject Zero from incoming Destroyers"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1979615021" "Car"
// Script Variable Greeting :
"P2275253406" "Hello there son"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3793214176" "I'm dead!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P2853767150" "Yeah! These weaklings won't be able to ignore us now!"
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3524992672" "Interruption, huh? HUH?!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P270267494" "Red Bomb will see this for sure. We'll get in on all his big operations."
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P2591579111" "Feelin' the crush! YEAH!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P2360360305" "Crushin' real bad here... gotta find something... find something..."
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3036829943" "Yeah, got somethin' RIGHT HERE!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P560194292" "We're runnin' out of crush& we gotta latch onto Red Bomb's group...!"
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION2 :
